# Consumer UX & Personas

- Non-crypto adults must finish core flows without seed phrases, gas, or chain pickers.
- Walk as: first-timer, busy parent, returning user, curious visitor — log in `memory/PERSONAS.md`.
- Prefer plain English: “Rent paid”, “Blocked — keep your $200”, not tx hashes in the hero UI.
- Demo opens on the block screen, not an empty composer.
- If removing a wallet/chain label does not hurt understanding, remove it.
